codex
I found the root cause of the Lean failure: this sandbox permits `/proc/self/exe` but denies the numeric `/proc/<pid>/exe` path Lean 4.22 uses to locate itself. I’m applying a narrowly scoped runtime compatibility shim that maps only Lean’s current-process numeric path to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not modify the pinned Lean binary, generated project, or proof. Then I’ll rerun preflight, clean build, and the axiom query from scratch.
apply patch
